{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/06bb15b629b11cebf3719b87c5209bae.avif?t=1773728507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras_big/06bb15b629b11cebf3719b87c5209bae.avif?t=1773728507 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the warm glow of your very own tavern, where good food, great company, and grand adventures await! In <strong>The Blue Cut Hook</strong>, you're not just a business owner\u2014you\u2019re a friend, a mentor, and a cornerstone of the community. Build lasting relationships, craft mouthwatering meals, forge mighty weapons, and embark on thrilling quests to create the ultimate haven for adventurers and townsfolk alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/b2466187a013401e83084176c539209d.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/b2466187a013401e83084176c539209d.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/b2466187a013401e83084176c539209d.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tavern is more than just a place to eat\u2014it\u2019s a home. Lend a listening ear, solve problems, and earn the trust of your patrons. With each bond you forge, your reputation grows, and soon enough, you\u2019ll find yourself at the heart of a thriving community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d0c9fd5442cec388ab01cfcff61e83b7.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d0c9fd5442cec388ab01cfcff61e83b7.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d0c9fd5442cec388ab01cfcff61e83b7.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great tavern needs great food! Scour the world for exotic ingredients, unlock secret recipes, and craft a menu that keeps adventurers coming back for more. Will you serve hearty comfort food or daring new flavors from distant lands? The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d74fbcc9329cc941401a639c795fc71f.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d74fbcc9329cc941401a639c795fc71f.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d74fbcc9329cc941401a639c795fc71f.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers need the right gear to survive their quests, and that\u2019s where you come in! Hire a blacksmith, gather rare materials, and create powerful weapons and armor to aid your patrons. A well-equipped adventurer is a happy (and generous!) customer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/3a0201cd3457246a8788f43bb57d3639.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/3a0201cd3457246a8788f43bb57d3639.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/3a0201cd3457246a8788f43bb57d3639.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tavern, cultivate fresh ingredients, brew magical potions, and discover new ways to increase your profits. The path to success is filled with choices\u2014will you run a cozy family inn, a bustling adventurer\u2019s hub, or something truly unique?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/e0d7650cb59d42f9a0f3ab77e5c9fcbe.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/e0d7650cb59d42f9a0f3ab77e5c9fcbe.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/e0d7650cb59d42f9a0f3ab77e5c9fcbe.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all challenges happen within your walls. Accept requests from villagers, nobles, and even the royal court! Hunt down elusive creatures, gather rare materials, and solve mysteries that could change the fate of your town. Adventure is never far away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tavern is waiting. Are you ready to create a place where stories unfold, friendships blossom, and legends are made?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nostalgic 90\u2019s anime visual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A D&amp;D-like world with character designs inspired by the classic anime art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i