re_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d74fbcc9329cc941401a639c795fc71f.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d74fbcc9329cc941401a639c795fc71f.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/d74fbcc9329cc941401a639c795fc71f.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers need the right gear to survive their quests, and that\u2019s where you come in! Hire a blacksmith, gather rare materials, and create powerful weapons and armor to aid your patrons. A well-equipped adventurer is a happy (and generous!) customer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/3a0201cd3457246a8788f43bb57d3639.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/3a0201cd3457246a8788f43bb57d3639.webm?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/3a0201cd3457246a8788f43bb57d3639.mp4?t=1773728507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tavern, cultivate fresh ingredients, brew magical potions, and discover new ways to increase your profits. The path to success is filled with choices\u2014will you run a cozy family inn, a bustling adventurer\u2019s hub, or something truly unique?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/e0d7650cb59d42f9a0f3ab77e5c9fcbe.poster.avif?t=1773728507\" width=1170 height=870 ><sour